                    This limit is not a defect to hide. It directs the learner outward. Questions about personal culpability may require a confessor. Persistent psychological distress may require a clinician. Complex moral decisions may need trained pastoral or professional counsel. Immediate danger requires appropriate emergency or protective action. The app should help users recognize those thresholds rather than keeping attention inside itself.

                    Religious activity can also become avoidance. A person may consume lectures and devotions while withholding wages, neglecting family, refusing apology, or remaining isolated. James warns against hearing without doing, and the sacramental life itself sends believers into charity. Genuine formation returns us to the next person and duty with greater truth, mercy, courage, and competence.
